    "description": "Daily Color : a relaxed paint by number game.  \r\nColor Your Day with Daily Color, a calming and easy experience designed for everyone.\r\nThere are so many coloring pages and new pictures be updated every day! You can relax by painting art, with \r\n\ud83c\udfdenature, \u2764\ufe0flove, \ud83c\udf37florals, \ud83e\uddd8characters, \ud83c\udff5mandalas and so on.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n- Painting easy: Just choose what you like and start coloring. Simple, calming and satisfying.\r\n- Various pictures and updated everyday. Great variety of categories can be chosen.\r\n- Share your artworks with friends and families on social networks",
